      "score": 8,
      "weight": 10,
      "rationale": "Second-order craft visible: F3 quarantines not delete (audit trail); F8/F9 OTEL substitution over hand-roll; Stop-hook R5-lite closes loop boundedly; F6 craft/facts split hits root semantic blur. Forward-looking REBUILD Qs. Could articulate ‘enables X’ more."
